          "short": "Straight segment from $(0,5)$ to $(10,10)$, with time in seconds and speed in m/s.",
          "worked": "Plot $(0,5)$, $(2,6)$, $(4,7)$, $(6,8)$, $(8,9)$ and $(10,10)$ on axes labelled Time (s) and Speed (m/s). Join the points with a straight line.",
          "solutionDiagrams": [
